\pard\b\fs20 Year 753: Adventure at the Arall Sea\b0\par
\fs16\par
Some of our scientists think we are damaging our environment too much. They even say that our planet will not hold out long enough for us to reach for the stars. Since we have little to lose and much to gain from protecting the environment (namely the survival of us all), the necessary research is now to be started. But we do not have a majority in the international council yet... so some persuading still has to be done. Now, as part of a project of the UR (United Rocketeers), an expedition team has been sent to the Arall Sea to contaminate its surroundings, and so to show how much damage pollution can do. Besides, an old artifact of unknown origin has been sighted there, which might help us.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Find the old artifact, then research rocket propulsion, build a test rocket and pollute the environment as much as possible.\par
\par
\b Tip:\b0\par
You will need an airship to reach the artifact...\par
